sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser / CLI
    participant Edge as Cloud Run Front End<br/>prism.llm-d.ai 443/TCP TLS
    participant P as Prism Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GH as GitHub<br/>github.com / api.github.com 443/TCP
    participant GCS as Google Cloud Storage<br/>storage.googleapis.com 443/TCP
    participant GIQ as GIQ API<br/>gkerecommender.googleapis.com 443/TCP

    Note over B,GCS: Flow 1: Dashboard viewing (GCS benchmark data)
    B->>Edge: GET /api/gcs/* (HTTPS, no auth)
    Edge->>P: HTTP 8080 (internal to Cloud Run)
    P->>GCS: Read objects in configured buckets<br/>HTTPS, GCP ADC Bearer
    GCS-->>P: Benchmark data
    P-->>B: JSON

    Note over B,GIQ: Flow 2: GIQ profile lookup
    B->>P: /api/giq/* via edge TLS<br/>Optional user Bearer
    P->>GIQ: HTTPS<br/>User Bearer OR server ADC + X-Goog-User-Project
    GIQ-->>P: Profiles and cost data
    P-->>B: Response (anonymous callers use server quota)

    Note over B,GH: Flow 3: GitHub login
    B->>P: GET /api/auth/github/login
    P-->>B: 302 to github.com/login/oauth/authorize<br/>scope read:user read:org
    B->>GH: Authorize
    GH-->>B: 302 to /api/auth/github/callback?code&state
    B->>P: GET callback (OAuth code)
    P->>GH: POST /login/oauth/access_token<br/>Client ID + secret
    GH-->>P: Access + refresh tokens
    P-->>B: 302 to /?view=manage-benchmarks#access_token=...<br/>Token in URL fragment (state not verified server-side)

    Note over B,GCS: Flow 4: Benchmark submission (UI or prism-results CLI)
    B->>P: POST /api/results (BRv0.2, up to 50 MB)<br/>X-Prism-Github-Token
    P->>GH: GET /user, /orgs/llm-d/memberships/{user}<br/>User token (every request, no cache)
    GH-->>P: Identity + org role
    P->>GCS: Read prism-iam/github-{admin,user}-allowlist.txt<br/>GCP ADC
    GCS-->>P: Allowlists
    Note over P: permission = max(org role, allowlist role)<br/>requires user or admin
    P->>GCS: Write run payload to results-store prefix<br/>state submitted_pending_review
    P-->>B: 201 runId (crypto.randomUUID)

    Note over B,GCS: Flow 4 step 5: Admin review
    B->>P: POST /api/results/:runId/review<br/>Admin GitHub token
    P->>GH: Re-validate token + org membership
    P->>GCS: Update run state (approve / reject)
    P-->>B: Updated run
